\newlabel{tab:exp1_results}{{1}{4}{Variance and MSE at traffic split 80/20. Harmonic consistently outperforms both original and min. Clipped achieves near-zero variance but bias$^2 \approx 0.041$, giving MSE $\approx 145\times $ higher than harmonic}{table.caption.4}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Variance reduction (\%) of harmonic and min relative to original, across traffic splits and imbalance ratios. Harmonic consistently dominates min; gains increase with both split and ratio.}}{4}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
