\newlabel{fig:pbm_violations}{{4}{4}{MSE decomposition (bias$^2$ + variance) under two PBM violation models. Original, min, and harmonic share comparable bias$^2$ under both violations; harmonic achieves lower variance and thus lower MSE. Clipped weights introduce large additional bias}{figure.caption.7}{}}
